<title>UK: Hamburgische LB sets 250 mln mark Dec 2000 bond.</title>
<headline>Hamburgische LB sets 250 mln mark Dec 2000 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was self-led by Hamburgische Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HAMBURGISCHE LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.0 PCT   MATURITY  **29.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  100.10    PAY DATE    23.SEP.96</p>
<p> NOTE	 * TO 30.DEC.96, THEREAFTER 5.25 PCT</p>
<p>		SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		** CALL AT PAR ON 30.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING    HAMBURG   DENOMS (K) 10	  GOV LAW    GERMAN</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
